1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:06,900
Walt hangs his lantern next to the
phone. The flame leans toward the cut
cord. On the cord, a paper tag. Line
9.

2
00:00:07,400 --> 00:00:12,067
Rule two. Let it ring four times. The
fifth ring is the one that listens.

3
00:00:12,567 --> 00:00:13,367
Why four?

4
00:00:14,567 --> 00:00:18,233
Walt taps a little white button under
the receiver. The hook switch.

5
00:00:18,733 --> 00:00:24,433
Rule three. Keep one finger on the
hook. You can't hang up on something
you can't reach.
